     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hi there,<div><br></div><div>Awesome work on the new Shiny application layout! Was tinkering around with fluidPage() and column() and might&#39;ve found a possible bug.. I understand the first argument passed to column() is an integer specifying the span. When I try a span of 6 on both navlistPanel and wellPanel, the lengths differ:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">shinyUI(fluidPage(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  fluidRow(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    column(6,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           navlistPanel(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             &quot;Header A&quot;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             tabPanel(&quot;Component 1&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  fluidRow(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    column(6,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           wellPanel(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             sliderInput(&quot;obs&quot;, &quot;Number of subjects:&quot;,  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">                         min = 1, max = 10, value = 1)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           )       </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">))</font></div></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Shouldn&#39;t a span of 6 be the same length for both navlistPanel and wellPanel widgets?</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Screenshot:</font><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-j4lAu8ZNxn8/UrI3c5AzhJI/AAAAAAAAALQ/l4qLfUjZpMc/s1600/Screen+Shot+2013-12-18+at+4.01.39+PM.png\" style=\"line-height:18px;text-align:center;margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-j4lAu8ZNxn8/UrI3c5AzhJI/AAAAAAAAALQ/l4qLfUjZpMc/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2013-12-18%2Bat%2B4.01.39%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792405565446000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EnVNNG0Eas450dJIbo7J0\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-j4lAu8ZNxn8/UrI3c5AzhJI/AAAAAAAAALQ/l4qLfUjZpMc/s320/Screen+Shot+2013-12-18+at+4.01.39+PM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"107\"></a></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Thanks!</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Alan</font></div></div>"
