    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Alan,<div><br></div><div>Check the docs for navlistPanel -- it actually creates it&#39;s own 12-wide sub-container with the navlist on the left and the content on the right. There is a widths parameter that controls the proportions -- it defaults to c(4, 8), so what you are seeing is that navlist occupying 33% of the 6 columns you defined for it.</div><div><br></div><div>J.J.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Wednesday, December 18, 2013 7:02:23 PM UTC-5, Alan Eng wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hi there,<div><br></div><div>Awesome work on the new Shiny application layout! Was tinkering around with fluidPage() and column() and might&#39;ve found a possible bug.. I understand the first argument passed to column() is an integer specifying the span. When I try a span of 6 on both navlistPanel and wellPanel, the lengths differ:</div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">shinyUI(fluidPage(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  fluidRow(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    column(6,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           navlistPanel(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             &quot;Header A&quot;,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             tabPanel(&quot;Component 1&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    )</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  ),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  fluidRow(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">    column(6,</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           wellPanel(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">             sliderInput(&quot;obs&quot;, &quot;Number of subjects:&quot;,  </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">                         min = 1, max = 10, value = 1)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">           )       </font></div><div><font face=\"courier new,